#
# Form 221, Arizona's underpayment of estimated tax form, for 2025, the latest
# published: Part A and Part B on page 1, the Annualized Income Installment
# Worksheet on page 2. One anchor per line the estimated tax rules fill. Part
# B's computations repeat for four rate periods; lines 16 to 18 stand for
# each period's three lines. Page numbers count the PDF's pages from 1.

